# Fault g1b_unit_key (writer 6): `unit(x) == PLN` over `x in places` was refused LOAD-UNIT ("unitkey and key
# currencies compared"). L §5.10 (round 7c): "`unit(x)` is x's unit as a key of the unit kind that holds it
# (`currencies` for a currency, §5.7), so `unit(x) == PLN` compares two keys". The places' units differ (konto PLN, world
# of unit any), so the key's kind is known only at run; `and` stops at `not x in outside` for world (L §5.11), so
# unit(world) is never read. konto at 2026-12-31: 12 payments of 10.00 PLN out from 0: -120.00 PLN.
=== m.tally
model m
  tally 2
  on 2027-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2027-12-31

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..

index month = month 2026-01..2027-12

input amt: money PLN

move pay[m in month]: transfers
  on start_of(m)
  leg cash from konto to world amount amt

source s "x"

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 10
  opening[konto] = 0 at 2026-01-01 start


ask q: sum(bal(x, 2026-12-31) for x in places over .. where not x in outside and unit(x) == PLN)
=== expect
q: -120.00 PLN
...
